Forward each native harness's subscription usage windows to the server.

claude-native keeps the statusLine's rate_limits (5-hour and weekly) that it
already captures for the context ring, and posts them whenever the statusLine
re-renders. codex-native reads account/rateLimits/read from its app-server at
turn start and end. Both post external_session_usage data.rate_limits, best-
effort and deduplicated. Pairs with the server patch 0002-rate-limits.patch and
the web patch 0001-composer-rate-limits.patch. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

